    "Health" : {},
    "Health %@" : {},
    "Here's how your Mac is doing" : {},
    "Hidden settings and deeper name matches are searched automatically. The direct edition also checks exact app IDs in per-user temporary/cache folders. These results start unchosen; temporary data may contain unsaved work." : {},
    "Hide Card" : {},
    "Hide Chart" : {},
    "Hide the chart and give the list the whole pane" : {},
    "High pressure" : {},
    "History" : {},
    "Home" : {},
    "Homebrew formulae and casks, and packages installers put on the Mac, read from where they're kept. Nothing is run and nothing is removed here: a package goes with its own tool, so its records stay right." : {},
    "Homebrew isn't installed in /opt/homebrew or /usr/local." : {},
    "Homebrew wasn't found, or this edition may not look where it installs: the App Sandbox keeps App Store apps out of /opt/homebrew and /usr/local." : {},
    "How hard scans may work. Lower levels use fewer threads at a lower priority, so the Mac stays quiet while scans take longer. A change applies from the next scan." : {},
    "How long lists, table menus, app listings and Disk Map scans take, including the first content. Kept in memory until you quit; no file names or paths." : {},
    "How to draw the disk map" : {},
    "Icicle, levels left to right" : {},
    "Icons" : {},
    "Identical Files" : {},
    "Identical duplicates" : {},
    "If an ordinary app move is denied, MyMole asks permission to control Finder. Finder can then ask for administrator approval for the app you already chose. You do not need to select the app again." : {},
    "If file permissions still block the move, use Show App in Finder in the review. Finder can request an administrator's approval." : {},
    "If it goes: %@" : {},
    "If macOS asks you to quit and reopen MyMole, follow that prompt. This page continues automatically when access is detected." : {},
    "In Documents" : {},
    "In Downloads" : {},
    "In Privacy & Security → Full Disk Access, turn on this copy of MyMole. If it isn't listed, use + to add it. Show This Copy in Finder locates the app you're using now." : {},
