    "It has used a whole core for %lld minutes or more, and may be stuck. Look at it in Live Status, or quit it if you don't need it." : {},
    "It isn't a scan saved from MyMole." : {},
    "It left %@ of settings, caches and data in your Library. Click to look at them." : {},
    "It starts in the menu bar, without a window, and scans when the Mac has time to spare." : {},
    "It stopped part-way, and what it had moved aside is still in %@, with a note of where each item came from. MyMole never deletes it by itself, and a new removal only deletes what it moves itself. Look at it in Finder; it needs an administrator to open." : {},
