    "Items" : {},
    "Items moved to the Trash still take space until you empty it. Items deleted for good are counted separately on each run." : {},
    "Its name or app ID has a development, preview or test label. This isn't proof it's disposable." : {},
    "Its window opens at login. With the menu bar item on, it starts there instead." : {},
    "Jobs an app registers from inside itself aren't files, so they aren't listed here. Turn those off in System Settings → General → Login Items & Extensions." : {},
