    "MyMole couldn't read inside this folder" : {},
    "MyMole couldn't read the Trash." : {},
    "MyMole couldn't tell whether it has Full Disk Access: none of the folders it checks are on this Mac. It goes on as if it has; a folder it can't read is said where it shows up." : {},
    "MyMole doesn't have Full Disk Access, so the folders macOS protects stay closed to it." : {},
    "MyMole found things to clean" : {},
    "MyMole has Full Disk Access." : {},
    "MyMole is a native Mac cleaner. Everything it removes is chosen by you; your own files go to the Trash, with Undo. In the direct edition, system caches are deleted after macOS asks for an administrator's password." : {},
    "MyMole is closing." : {},
    "MyMole is in the Trash. Some chosen data couldn't be moved and stays where it is. Quit when you're ready." : {},
    "MyMole is preparing to uninstall and quit." : {},
    "MyMole is source-available. Personal non-commercial use is permitted; business and organizational use requires a paid commercial license." : {},
    "MyMole keeps every scan of a folder. Scan again later — after an update, a project, a week of use — and compare any two to see exactly what grew." : {},
    "MyMole keeps what it needs to put things back for the last moves of each pane while it runs. After that, or after quitting, Finder's Put Back still works for whatever is in the Trash. This history keeps only counts and sizes, never names." : {},
    "MyMole looks for folders with a project file (Package.swift, package.json, .git …) in %@." : {},
    "MyMole looks for folders with a project file (Package.swift, package.json, .git …) in no folders yet." : {},
    "MyMole needs Full Disk Access before it can scan. What's shown is from earlier scans." : {},
    "MyMole needs Full Disk Access first." : {},
    "MyMole needs access first." : {},
    "MyMole needs access to %@ first." : {},
    "MyMole needs access to protected folders to find caches, app leftovers and disk usage. Scanning waits until access is available." : {},
    "MyMole needs access to your home folder before it can scan. What's shown is from earlier scans." : {},
    "MyMole needs administrator approval to restore the app from your Trash." : {},
    "MyMole needs administrator approval to stop %@'s bundled background agents and move the app to your Trash." : {},
    "MyMole needs administrator rights to delete system caches and logs." : {},
    "MyMole needs administrator rights to delete what the app left outside your Library." : {},
    "MyMole needs administrator rights to run system maintenance." : {},
    "MyMole stopped waiting for the privileged tool, which may still be running. What it changed isn't known yet, so no other system task runs until it has ended." : {},
    "MyMole stops its scans, turns off Open at Login and moves this copy to the Trash, then quits. Settings and saved results stay unless you choose them. Data another installed copy uses stays. Use Put Back in Finder's Trash to restore anything moved." : {},
    "MyMole, %@ free" : {},
