    "Their contents aren't counted above. Most are protected by macOS; Full Disk Access lets MyMole see inside the ones that belong to you." : {},
    "Theme" : {},
    "Themes change the surfaces and the accent; text and warning colours stay the system's. Spacious gives margins, rows and the gaps between columns more room. Compact fits the most on screen. Table lines separate the rows of every list, or its rows and columns; without them, file lists are striped." : {},
    "These components may serve other Google products or installations. They aren't attributed exclusively to this app and aren't separate removal choices here." : {},
    "They appear here as the scan finds them." : {},
    "They couldn't be read through, or changed while they were read, so whether they have copies isn't known. Search again to try them." : {},
